<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">26032026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran's foreign minister has divided the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="streɪt əv hɔrˈmuːz">Strait of Hormuz</phoneme> into two tiers — friendly nations pass freely, everyone else asks permission.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Abbas Araghchi named China, Russia, India, Iraq, and Pakistan as cleared for transit, turning a military blockade into something closer to a geopolitical loyalty test over the waterway that carries a fifth of the world's oil.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The UN's warned of mounting commodity disruptions, and Araghchi has ruled out any negotiations with the United States.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Spain's prime minister told parliament his country won't open its airbases to the United States, defying direct trade threats from Washington.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Pedro Sanchez called the Iran war far worse than the two thousand three invasion of Iraq — two thousand dead, four million displaced, and a hundred billion euros in losses to Spanish companies in a single month.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>It's a sharp reversal for a NATO ally whose conservative party backed the Iraq war and lost power because of it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington's told Kyiv it won't finalize security guarantees unless Ukraine withdraws from the Donbas entirely.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Zelenskyy says Trump's distracted by the Iran war while Russia demands Ukraine cede six thousand square kilometers of fortified territory.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Only a three-way summit between Trump, Putin, and Zelenskyy can break the deadlock, he argues — but nobody's proposed one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Organizers expect Saturday's No Kings protests to be the largest in American history, with events planned in every congressional district across all fifty states.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Previous rounds drew five million and then seven million people into the streets.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>A general strike is now planned for May first as the movement's next escalation.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel locked down every prison when the Iran war began, cutting hundreds of Palestinian detainees off from lawyers and courts alike.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>At the same time, settlers are pushing into Areas B and A of the West Bank — territory under Palestinian Authority jurisdiction — erasing the last operational lines drawn by the Oslo Accords.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>What's being built in the West Bank, and what's being denied inside Israeli prisons, are two faces of the same erasure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two weeks of Israeli ground operations haven't secured Khiam, the hilltop town that controls supply lines to Lebanon's Beqaa Valley.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Hezbollah fighters are using what analysts call kill pockets — luring armor into narrow approaches, striking, then repositioning before Israeli forces can consolidate.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The town's center remains in Hezbollah's hands.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Cairo court acquitted a man despite three confirmed incidents of sexual harassment on public buses, offering no explanation for the ruling.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>It's a pattern in Egyptian misdemeanor cases, where acquittals arrive without written reasoning and only the state prosecutor can appeal.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The Egyptian Initiative for Personal Rights is demanding exactly that — but whether the prosecution acts is another question entirely.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Iran war pushed Trump's Beijing summit back six weeks, to mid-May — and China's leverage has only grown in the delay.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Beijing imports one point three eight million barrels of Iranian crude per day and refused Washington's request to help reopen Hormuz.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>New Section three-oh-one probes will set tariff levels when the current ten percent stopgap expires in July, so Xi walks into the room holding both the oil card and the trade card.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brussels activated the EU-Mercosur trade deal through provisional application, sidestepping a legal challenge from the European Parliament.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Tariff cuts on ninety percent of goods across a seven hundred million person market begin May first, overriding opposition led by France and Poland.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Trade starts — and halts only if the European Court of Justice strikes it down.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's state energy company PetroSA awarded a one point two billion dollar gas contract to Equator Holdings.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Four months later, Equator was liquidated — for failing to pay a soccer player seventy thousand rand in wages.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The company's director settled the debt to reverse the order and is now pressing PetroSA to honor a deal worth more than a million times what nearly killed the firm.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's fuel dealers scrapped a planned strike after the Iran war raised the specter of supply cuts before they could recoup losses from a fifty-five rupee per litre price hike.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The government, meanwhile, is building an app-based fuel quota system without consulting the dealers it's meant to regulate.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>War didn't resolve the dispute — it just silenced one side.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The <sub alias="World Meteorological Organization">WMO</sub>'s twenty twenty-five report confirms eleven consecutive hottest years on record and, for the first time, quantifies Earth's energy imbalance at a sixty-five year high.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Ninety percent of the excess heat now sits in the oceans, reshaping weather systems from below the surface in ways land-based measurements alone can't capture.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>An El Niño return later this year could push twenty twenty-six toward yet another record.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study in Nature has found that androgens — not sex chromosomes — drive a fatal brain tumor in boys called ependymoma.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The hormones keep male hindbrain stem cells immature longer, producing more aggressive tumors in a cancer that strikes at age three with a fifty percent five-year survival rate.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Blocking androgen receptors in lab models stopped tumor growth, opening a path that could, God willing, reach clinical trials within years.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An eighty-eight country dengue surveillance system went live this week, mapping real-time case data as climate change pushes mosquito habitats beyond the tropics.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Health ministries can now preposition medical supplies before outbreaks peak, rather than scrambling after hospitals fill.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>It's the first global system built to turn climate projections directly into public health logistics.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Google's revised its estimate for when quantum computers will break current encryption — and the new deadline is twenty twenty-nine, years earlier than previous forecasts.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>NIST finalized post-quantum replacement standards in twenty twenty-four, but migrating the infrastructure of every bank, government, and encrypted service on Earth is a different problem entirely.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Three years sounds distant until you consider that most institutions haven't started.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A security researcher in Budapest bought wrecked Tesla Model Three components online and assembled them into a working desk computer.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The main unit booted fully intact, with all the previous owner's personal data still accessible — contacts, routes, credentials, everything.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Anyone buying crashed Tesla parts on the open market can do the same, a privacy gap that persists until automakers treat salvage data the way they treat recalls.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>